      "updated_at": "2024-04-25T19:55:25Z",
      "body": "For the pose parameters, we use the mean hand pose from MANO (`hands_mean`). For the shape parameters, we inherit the average shape used by [HMR networks](https://github.com/akanazawa/hmr) (which is indeed computed as average across all body shapes from MoCap data).\r\n\r\nThe pretrained network expects this file to be available. If you don't want to use this file and you train a new model, I expect you will still get good performance regardless (maybe with a small drop).",
